&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in; break-after: avoid; border-image: initial; line-height: 1; border: medium none currentcolor;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; color: black;"&gt;At March&amp;#160;31, 2026, OG&amp;amp;E was in compliance with all of its debt agreements.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; break-after: avoid; border-image: initial; line-height: 1; border: medium none currentcolor;"&gt;&lt;strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; color: black;"&gt;OG&amp;amp;E Industrial Authority Bonds&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
