&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in; break-after: avoid; border-image: initial; line-height: 1; border: medium none currentcolor;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; color: black;"&gt;During the three months ended March&amp;#160;31, 2026, OGE Energy issued 168,659&amp;#160;shares of new common stock pursuant to OGE Energy's Stock Incentive Plan to satisfy payouts of earned performance units and restricted stock unit grants to OG&amp;amp;E's employees.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in; border-image: initial; line-height: 1; border: medium none currentcolor;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; color: black;"&gt;During the three months ended March&amp;#160;31, 2026, OGE Energy granted 220,459 performance units (based on total shareholder return over a three-year period) and 129,233 restricted stock units (primarily with a three-year cliff vesting period) to OG&amp;amp;E's employees at $56.63 and $46.45 fair value per share, respectively. &lt;font style="mso-spacerun: yes;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="break-after: avoid; border-image: initial; line-height: 1; border: medium none currentcolor;"&gt;&lt;strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; color: black;"&gt;Statement of Cash Flows&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
